sequenceDiagram
    participant DEV as IoT Device
    participant GW as Edge Gateway
    participant MQTT as MQTT Broker
    participant MQ as Message Queue
    participant WORKER as Consumer Worker
    participant API as Backend API
    participant REDIS as Redis
    participant MYSQL as MySQL
    participant PUSH as Socket.IO Gateway
    participant CLIENT as Client App

    DEV->>GW: Sensor data / Alert (MQTT over TLS)
    activate GW
    GW->>GW: Heartbeat check
    GW->>MQTT: Publish to topic
    deactivate GW

    activate MQTT
    MQTT->>MQTT: QoS 1 delivery
    MQTT->>MQ: Stream event
    deactivate MQTT

    activate MQ
    MQ->>WORKER: Consume batch
    deactivate MQ

    activate WORKER
    WORKER->>WORKER: Idempotency check
    WORKER->>REDIS: Acquire distributed lock
    activate REDIS
    REDIS-->>WORKER: Lock acquired
    deactivate REDIS

    WORKER->>MYSQL: Insert alert record
    activate MYSQL
    MYSQL-->>WORKER: OK
    deactivate MYSQL

    WORKER->>API: POST /internal/alert
    activate API
    API->>API: Validate & enrich

    API->>MYSQL: Create work order
    activate MYSQL
    MYSQL-->>API: Work order created
    deactivate MYSQL

    API->>REDIS: Publish event (PubSub)
    activate REDIS
    REDIS-->>API: Published
    deactivate REDIS

    API->>PUSH: Push notification
    activate PUSH
    PUSH->>CLIENT: Socket.IO event
    activate CLIENT
    CLIENT-->>PUSH: ACK
    deactivate CLIENT
    deactivate PUSH

    API-->>WORKER: 201 Created
    deactivate API

    WORKER->>REDIS: Release lock
    activate REDIS
    REDIS-->>WORKER: Released
    deactivate REDIS

    WORKER->>MQ: ACK message
    deactivate WORKER

    Note over DEV,CLIENT: If worker fails, message goes to Dead Letter Queue and retries with backoff

    CLIENT->>API: Update work order status
    activate API
    API->>MYSQL: Update status
    activate MYSQL
    MYSQL-->>API: OK
    deactivate MYSQL
    API->>REDIS: Invalidate cache
    activate REDIS
    REDIS-->>API: Cache cleared
    deactivate REDIS
    API-->>CLIENT: 200 OK
    deactivate API

    Note over DEV,CLIENT: Work order lifecycle: Created → Assigned → In Progress → Resolved → Closed
